        {
          "id": 587720993,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I already have the Qt version in the about dialog:\n\n```\n3.5.0 (v3.5.0rc0-2003-g9dbe29e2ecb2)\n\nCompiled (64-bit) with Qt 5.12.8, with libpcap, with POSIX capabilities (Linux),\nwith libnl 3, with GLib 2.64.6, with zlib 1.2.11, with Lua 5.2.4, with GnuTLS\n3.6.13 and PKCS #11 support, with Gcrypt 1.8.5, with MIT Kerberos, with MaxMind\nDB resolver, with nghttp2 1.40.0, with brotli, with LZ4, with Zstandard, with\nSnappy, with libxml2 2.9.10, with SMI 0.4.8, with QtMultimedia, without\nautomatic updates, with SpeexDSP (using system library), with Minizip.\n\nRunning on Linux 5.8.0-53-generic, with Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8665U CPU @ 1.90GHz\n(with SSE4.2), with 31740 MB of physical memory, with GLib 2.64.6, with zlib\n1.2.11, with libpcap 1.9.1 (with TPACKET_V3), with c-ares 1.15.0, with GnuTLS\n3.6.13, with Gcrypt 1.8.5, with nghttp2 1.40.0, with brotli 1.0.7, with LZ4\n1.9.2, with Zstandard 1.4.4, with libsmi 0.4.8, with light display mode, without\nHiDPI, with locale LC_CTYPE=en_US.UTF-8, LC_NUMERIC=de_AT.UTF-8,\nLC_TIME=de_AT.UTF-8, LC_COLLATE=en_US.UTF-8, LC_MONETARY=de_AT.UTF-8,\nLC_MESSAGES=en_US.UTF-8, LC_PAPER=de_AT.UTF-8, LC_NAME=de_AT.UTF-8,\nLC_ADDRESS=de_AT.UTF-8, LC_TELEPHONE=de_AT.UTF-8, LC_MEASUREMENT=de_AT.UTF-8,\nLC_IDENTIFICATION=de_AT.UTF-8, binary plugins supported (21 loaded).\n\nBuilt using gcc 9.3.0.\n```\n\nWhy is the additional information needed?",
