          "id": 587747425,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Well, how else would I make my life harder ;-) \n\nThen the text would be wrong, as we explicitly write \"Compiled with ...\". It also does not go with my experience, where usually this reflects the Qt version it was compiled with.\n\nHave nothing against the generic addition of information, just want to avoid duplicates",
